  "name": "omega-bridge-kit",
  "purpose": "Mac-side kit that shows the Omega bridge converting C/Python to .om and back to C, Python, native AArch64 and WebAssembly, runs every form on the same seeded inputs and compares them, with a CLI (omb) and a local UI.",
